---

<div id="cookie-banner" role="region" aria-label="Cookie notice" style="
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  bottom: 1.25rem;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  z-index: 1000;
  background: var(--bg-secondary);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-hover);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  max-width: 560px;
  width: calc(100% - 2rem);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
">
  <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem; margin: 0; flex: 1; line-height: 1.5;">
    <span class="lang-en">This site sets no cookies and has no tracking or analytics. One local entry remembers that you dismissed this notice.</span>
    <span class="lang-de">Diese Website setzt keine Cookies und hat kein Tracking und keine Analyse. Ein lokaler Eintrag merkt sich, dass du diesen Hinweis geschlossen hast.</span>
    <a href="/cookies" style="color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; margin-left: 0.35em;"><span class="lang-en">Learn more</span><span class="lang-de">Mehr erfahren</span></a>
  </p>
  <button id="cookie-accept" type="button" style="
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  ">OK</button>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var banner = document.getElementById('cookie-banner');
    if (!banner) return;
    var accepted = false;
    try { accepted = !!localStorage.getItem('cookie-accepted'); } catch (_) {}
    if (!accepted) banner.style.display = 'flex';
    document.getElementById('cookie-accept').addEventListener('click', function () {
      try { localStorage.setItem('cookie-accepted', '1'); } catch (_) {}
      banner.style.display = 'none';
    });
  })();
</script>
